whatsdown (3-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Release 3 (Functional).
  * Reduce chat and sync memory usage and bound image caches.
  * Add clickable message URLs and day separators.
  * Display single-emoji messages with 64pt jumbo emojis in chat bubbles.
  * Fix Mark all as read failures by recovering from app-state snapshot LTHash mismatches and retrying on 409 conflict errors.
  * Synchronize read receipts from primary phone and catch up offline reads.
  * Play system notification sound on incoming messages.
  * Focus window, unminimize, navigate to chat, and scroll to message on notification activation.
  * Withdraw notifications when reading messages or marking chats as read.

 -- Emir Öven <emiroven@postbetasoftware.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:10:00 +0100

whatsdown (0.2.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * v0.2.0 (Colourful) release.
  * Add custom per-chat solid colour and image wallpapers, window tinting, and sidebar colour handles.
  * Add group creation modal, group permissions, participant management, and invite link/QR code copying.
  * Add @mention autocomplete and clickable @mention rendering in message bubbles.
  * Add Demo Mode for testing and screenshots.
  * Fix chat scroll locking, duplicate chats, community/titlebar avatar rendering, and profile picture rate limiting.

